otch white keyboard just like  i showed you guys in these renders i  think it's going to be absolutely  beautiful and i think the people who are  saying that the notch is ugly they're  going to take that back as soon as they  see the real thing that apple's going to  release it's just going to look awesome  so with that said hopefully you guys  enjoyed this video and if you did click  the circle above to subscribe for more  videos like this one check out one of  those two right over there and we'll see  you in the next video  [Music]

